# Files under the static root.
note the index, a stylesheet and a script, with their media types
conn
request GET /
request GET /style.css
request HEAD /app.js
note a binary file is sent as it is, so its digest matches the file's
conn
request GET /dot.png
note a directory answers its index.html
conn
request GET /docs
request GET /docs/
note a matching If-None-Match is a 304 with no body
conn
send GET /style.css HTTP/1.1
send Host: localhost
send If-None-Match: "fb26a694e2b85431"
send
send GET /style.css HTTP/1.1
send Host: localhost
send If-None-Match: "0000000000000000"
send
note hidden files and paths that climb out of the root are not found
conn
request GET /.private/secret.txt
request GET /docs/../.private/secret.txt
request GET /%2e%2e/check.sh
request GET /missing.html
